WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.354 --> 00:00:14.636
Jack was still trying to balance the pencil on his nose.

2
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.201
Roxy tapped Terrell's shoulder.

3
00:00:20.782 --> 00:00:21.462
He turned around.

4
00:00:21.482 --> 00:00:25.206
"There's a problem in the museum," Roxy whispered.

5
00:00:25.226 --> 00:00:26.948
"I'll be back."

6
00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:35.586
Roxy found Detective Smith in the North American wing.

7
00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:37.387
He was talking to a guard.

8
00:00:37.407 --> 00:00:40.790
"Hey, Detective," Roxy said.

9
00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.551
"Is your school here on a field trip?"

10
00:00:44.732 --> 00:00:46.113
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

11
00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.195
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

12
00:00:50.056 --> 00:00:52.077
I don't go to school anymore."

13
00:00:52.097 --> 00:00:54.439
"So what's going on?"

14
00:00:54.779 --> 00:00:55.420
Roxy asked.

15
00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:59.383
"Mayor Bloom said a valuable artifact is missing."

16
00:01:00.403 --> 00:01:01.204
The guard nodded.

17
00:01:01.972 --> 00:01:03.393
"A gold ring is missing."

18
00:01:04.753 --> 00:01:06.034
She pointed at a glass case.

19
00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:08.135
"It's usually in there.

20
00:01:08.575 --> 00:01:09.755
But now it's gone."

21
00:01:11.276 --> 00:01:12.496
A man hurried into the room.

22
00:01:12.516 --> 00:01:14.037
"What's going on?"

23
00:01:15.217 --> 00:01:16.178
The guard looked nervous.

24
00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:18.699
"Professor Beard," she said.

25
00:01:18.719 --> 00:01:20.740
"The gold ring is missing.

26
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.340
I called the police."

27
00:01:23.401 --> 00:01:24.581
Professor Beard chuckled.

28
00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:26.762
"Don't be silly.

29
00:01:27.302 --> 00:01:27.982
Nothing is missing."

30
00:01:29.343 --> 00:01:31.484
"Huh?" Detective Smith raised an eyebrow.

31
00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:33.444
The guard frowned.

32
00:01:33.464 --> 00:01:36.506
"The ring is always in that case."

33
00:01:37.766 --> 00:01:39.767
"Nonsense!" Professor Beard said.

34
00:01:39.787 --> 00:01:41.048
"There's no ring!"

35
00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.288
Roxy looked at the professor.

36
00:01:44.329 --> 00:01:45.429
Then she looked at the guard.

37
00:01:45.449 --> 00:01:47.770
"Who's telling the truth?"

38
00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:48.731
she thought.

39
00:01:48.751 --> 00:01:52.112
"Are you serious, Professor?"

40
00:01:52.932 --> 00:01:54.233
The guard looked angry now.

41
00:01:54.253 --> 00:01:58.875
"There's even a sign with information about the gold ring!"

42
00:01:59.655 --> 00:02:01.536
She pointed at a small sign on the case.

43
00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.982
Roxy saw sweat drip down the professor's face.

44
00:02:06.002 --> 00:02:09.786
"Oh, um, I forgot," he said.

45
00:02:09.806 --> 00:02:12.308
"The ring was removed for cleaning."

46
00:02:12.328 --> 00:02:16.432
"I don't believe you, Professor," the guard said.

47
00:02:17.132 --> 00:02:19.354
Roxy and Detective Smith looked at Professor Beard.

48
00:02:20.495 --> 00:02:22.037
The professor puffed out his chest.

49
00:02:22.057 --> 00:02:24.959
"Fine! I'll tell you where the ring is.

50
00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:26.921
It's with its true owner!"

51
00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:30.224
The guard gasped.

52
00:02:31.456 --> 00:02:33.417
"Who's the real owner?"

53
00:02:33.757 --> 00:02:34.918
Detective Smith asked.

54
00:02:36.839 --> 00:02:38.240
Roxy read the sign on the case.

55
00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:44.783
"The ring belonged to an ancient caveman king named King Trog?"

56
00:02:46.084 --> 00:02:46.984
She scratched her head.

57
00:02:47.004 --> 00:02:48.945
"That's a silly name."

58
00:02:50.066 --> 00:02:51.127
Detective Smith nodded.

59
00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:53.028
"It sure is."

60
00:02:54.048 --> 00:02:55.769
Professor Beard's face grew red.

61
00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.751
"How dare you insult my master!"

62
00:02:58.771 --> 00:03:00.311
"Your master?"

63
00:03:00.612 --> 00:03:01.192
Roxy said.

64
00:03:02.304 --> 00:03:03.404
The professor ran away.

65
00:03:03.424 --> 00:03:06.845
"Hey!" Roxy flew after him.

66
00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:13.567
But a group of people got in her way.

67
00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:16.468
Professor Beard slipped through a door.

68
00:03:16.488 --> 00:03:18.488
"Rocket Girl!"

69
00:03:18.769 --> 00:03:19.809
Detective Smith called.

70
00:03:20.809 --> 00:03:22.350
Roxy flew back to the detective.

71
00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:24.250
He looked pale.

72
00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.131
"Professor Beard got away!"

73
00:03:27.471 --> 00:03:28.111
Roxy said.

74
00:03:28.131 --> 00:03:32.446
"We have a bigger problem now," Detective Smith said.

75
00:03:32.466 --> 00:03:35.070
"I just got a call from Mayor Bloom.

76
00:03:36.032 --> 00:03:38.055
King Trog is at City Hall!"
